{"t":"HPQ","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"HP Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","employees":55000,"hq":"Palo Alto, CA, United States","website":"https://www.hp.com","summary_en":"HP Inc. provides personal computing, printing, 3D printing, hybrid work, gaming, and other related technologies in the United States and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Personal Systems, Printing, and Corporate Investments. The Personal Systems segment offers commercial and consumer desktops and notebooks, workstations, thin clients, retail point-of-sale systems, displays, software, hybrid systems, and endpoint security and services, as well as lifecycle services, including support and deployment, configurations, and extended warranty services. The Printing segment provides consumer and commercial printer hardware, supplies, and solutions, as well as office and home printing solutions; and focuses on graphics, 3D printing, and personalization solutions for the commercial and industrial markets. The Corporate Investments segment is involved in the business incubation and investment projects. It serves small- and medium-sized businesses, public sector, and enterprises. The company was formerly known as Hewlett-Packard Company and changed its name to HP Inc. in October 2015. HP Inc. was founded in 1939 and is headquartered in Palo Alto, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"HP Inc.는 미국 및 해외에서 개인용 컴퓨팅, 프린팅, 3D 프린팅, 하이브리드 작업, 게임 및 기타 관련 기술을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 개인 시스템, 인쇄, 기업 투자의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 개인용 시스템 부문은 상업용 및 소비자용 데스크탑과 노트북, 워크스테이션, 씬 클라이언트, 소매 POS 시스템, 디스플레이, 소프트웨어, 하이브리드 시스템, 엔드포인트 보안 및 서비스는 물론 지원 및 배포, 구성, 연장된 보증 서비스를 포함한 라이프사이클 서비스도 제공합니다. 인쇄 부문은 소비자 및 상업용 프린터 하드웨어, 소모품, 솔루션은 물론 사무실 및 가정용 인쇄 솔루션도 제공합니다. 상업 및 산업 시장을 위한 그래픽, 3D 프린팅, 개인화 솔루션에 중점을 두고 있습니다. 기업 투자 부문은 비즈니스 인큐베이션 및 투자 프로젝트에 참여하고 있습니다. 중소기업, 공공 부문 및 기업에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Hewlett-Packard Company로 알려졌으며 2015년 10월에 HP Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. HP Inc.는 1939년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 팔로 알토에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":28.205,"mcap":25435015168.0,"pe":10.765267,"fpe":8.95593,"peg":3.1344,"ps":0.42992148,"pb":-276.51962,"ev_ebitda":6.879,"div":4.21,"beta":1.211,"hi52":36.23,"lo52":17.56},"fin":{"rev":59162001408.0,"rev_g":0.125,"eps_g":-0.113,"gross":0.1966,"op":0.06513,"net":0.04143,"roe":null,"fcf":3389874944.0,"cash":4168999936.0,"debt":10339000320.0,"de":null,"eps":2.62,"feps":3.14931},"own":{"short":0.099,"inst":0.93181,"insider":0.0029300002},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":27.55294,"median":29.0,"high":33.4,"low":20.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.33333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":4,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":4,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":3,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-09-11","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":33.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-28","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":23.0,"priorPriceTarget":19.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":30.0,"priorPriceTarget":26.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":28.0,"priorPriceTarget":26.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":19.0,"priorPriceTarget":17.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-24","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"L